msgid "Instantons"
msgstr "瞬子"

msgid "Thermal reaction rates"
msgstr "热反应速率"

msgid ""
"Quantum rate calculations proceed via an instanton which is equivalent to "
"the transition state on the ring-polymer surface. These stationary points "
"are computed using a quasi-Newton saddle-point search with Powell’s Hessian "
"update. Because of the known symmetry of the final geometry (that the ring "
"polymer folds back on itself), only half of the beads need be specified."
msgstr ""
"量子速率计算通过一个瞬子进行，该瞬子等价于环聚合物表面上的过渡态。这些驻点使用带有 Powell Hessian "
"更新的拟牛顿鞍点搜索计算。由于最终几何结构的已知对称性（环聚合物自身折叠），只需指定一半的珠粒。"

msgid ""
"The geometry of the transition state should be specified with the "
"``geometry`` keyword, and the classical TST rate through this point is "
"compared with the rate computed from the instanton. The action of the "
"instanton, its fluctuations and rotations are printed to the output file. "
"Molpro computes the tunnelling factor which is the ratio of these rates and "
"the rate itself can be calculated if the reactant partition function is "
"known. It is necessary to converge the results in the large-:math:`N` limit."
msgstr ""
"应使用 ``geometry`` 关键字指定过渡态的几何结构，并将通过该点的经典 TST "
"速率与从瞬子计算的速率进行比较。瞬子的作用量、其涨落和转动将打印到输出文件中。Molpro "
"计算隧穿因子，即这些速率的比值，如果已知反应物配分函数，则可以计算速率本身。必须在大的 :math:`N` 极限下收敛结果。"

msgid "References for the ring-polymer instanton method are:"
msgstr "环聚合物瞬子方法的参考文献有："

msgid ""
"Upon reaching the ``INSTANTON`` command, Molpro reads in data from the input"
" ``xyz`` file including the temperature and number of beads. :math:`\\beta`,"
" :math:`\\beta/N` and the bead masses in atomic units are computed and "
"printed to the output file. Next the values of the potential, moments of "
"inertia and frequencies of the transition-state, whose geometry is supplied "
"in the input file, are computed using calls to the procedures ``beadpot`` "
"and ``beadfreq1``. It is also determined whether or not the geometry is "
"linear in order to define the correct rotational partition function. The "
"user must ensure that the transition state is optimized sufficiently using "
"``optg,root=2`` before the ``INSTANTON`` command. A warning will ensue if "
"this is not the case. An approximate cross-over temperature "
":math:`\\beta_{\\text{c}}=2\\pi/\\hbar\\omega_{\\text{b}}`, where "
":math:`\\mathrm{i}\\omega_{\\text{b}}` is the imaginary frequency, below "
"which instantons exist is printed along with the fluctuations of a ring-"
"polymer collapsed at the transition state."
msgstr ""
"当执行到 ``INSTANTON`` 命令时，Molpro 会从输入的 ``xyz`` 文件中读取数据，包括温度和珠子数量。\\ "
":math:`\\beta`\\ 、\\ :math:`\\beta/N` 以及以原子单位表示的珠子质量会被计算并输出到结果文件中。接下来，通过调用过程"
" ``beadpot`` 和 ``beadfreq1``\\ "
"，计算输入文件中提供的过渡态几何结构的势能、转动惯量和频率值。同时，为了定义正确的转动配分函数，还会判断几何结构是否为线性。用户必须确保在使用 "
"``INSTANTON`` 命令之前，已使用 ``optg,root=2`` 对过渡态进行了充分优化。否则将发出警告。程序会输出一个近似交叉温度 "
":math:`\\beta_{\\text{c}}=2\\pi/\\hbar\\omega_{\\text{b}}`\\ （其中 "
":math:`\\mathrm{i}\\omega_{\\text{b}}` "
"是虚频），低于此温度时瞬子存在，同时还会输出在过渡态处塌缩的环状聚合物的涨落。"

msgid ""
"Next begins the instanton optimization. The ring-polymer gradient is "
"computed and, unless it is already sufficiently converged, an initial "
"Hessian using ``beadfreq2``. This does not need to be accurate although it "
"may reduced the number of iterations if it is. At each iteration, the quasi-"
"Newtonian algorithm diagonalizes the Hessian and takes a step upwards in the"
" direction of the lowest eigenmode and downwards in all others. The step "
"length is determined by the gradient and the values of the lowest two "
"eigenvalues and is scaled down if it exceeds ``STEPMAX``. The potential and "
"gradient of the new geometry are then computed using ``beadgrad`` and the "
"Hessian is updated using Powell’s scheme. If the matrix is very large, "
"diagonalization can become the slowest step in this process. In this case "
"the option ``banded`` can be supplied to convert the half-ring-polymer "
"Hessian into banded form which speeds up the computation."
msgstr ""
"接下来开始瞬子优化。计算环状聚合物的梯度，除非它已经充分收敛，否则使用 ``beadfreq2`` 计算初始 Hessian "
"矩阵。该矩阵不需要非常精确，但如果精确的话可能会减少迭代次数。在每次迭代中，拟牛顿算法对角化 Hessian "
"矩阵，沿最低本征模式方向向上移动一步，并在所有其他方向上向下移动。步长由梯度和最低两个特征值决定，如果超过 ``STEPMAX`` "
"则按比例缩小。然后使用 ``beadgrad`` 计算新几何结构的势能和梯度，并使用 Powell 方案更新 Hessian "
"矩阵。如果矩阵非常大，对角化可能成为此过程中最慢的步骤。在这种情况下，可以提供 ``banded`` 选项将半环状聚合物 Hessian "
"矩阵转换为带状形式，从而加快计算速度。"

msgid ""
"Upon convergence of the gradient or if the maximum number of iterations is "
"reached, the full-ring-polymer Hessian is computed using ``beadfreq3`` and "
"diagonalized. This matrix cannot be computed in banded form. There should be"
" one imaginary mode, zero modes corresponding to translations and rotations "
"and an extra zero mode due to the permutational symmetry of the ring "
"polymer. The normalization constant for this zero mode, :math:`B_N` is "
"computed and should not be zero. The eigenvector corresponding to the "
"imaginary eigenvalue is also computed and printed. If Molpro is run in "
"parallel with :math:`n` processes, the eigenvalues are computed on process 0"
" and the lowest eigenvector in process :math:`n-1`. Using the instanton’s "
"action and comparing its rotational and vibrational partition functions with"
" those of the collapsed ring polymer, one obtains the tunnelling factor."
msgstr ""
"当梯度收敛或达到最大迭代次数时，使用 ``beadfreq3`` 计算并对角化全环状聚合物 Hessian "
"矩阵。此矩阵无法以带状形式计算。应该存在一个虚模、对应于平动和转动的零模，以及一个由于环状聚合物置换对称性而产生的额外零模。计算此零模的归一化常数 "
":math:`B_N`\\ ，该常数不应为零。同时计算并输出对应于虚特征值的特征向量。如果 Molpro 在 :math:`n` "
"个进程上并行运行，则在进程 0 上计算特征值，在进程 :math:`n-1` "
"上计算最低特征向量。通过使用瞬子的作用量，并将其转动和振动配分函数与塌缩环状聚合物的配分函数进行比较，即可得到隧穿因子。"

msgid "Tunnelling splittings"
msgstr "隧穿分裂"

msgid ""
"Instantons used to compute tunnelling splittings are local minima on the "
"ring-polymer surface. They are located using the limited-memory Broyden-"
"Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno (L-BFGS) method. All publications describing work "
"using this method should quote at least one of these references:"
msgstr ""
"用于计算隧穿分裂的瞬子是环状聚合物势能面上的局部极小值。它们使用有限内存 Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno "
"(L-BFGS) 方法进行定位。所有使用此方法描述工作的出版物应至少引用以下参考文献之一："

msgid ""
"The geometry of the well minimum should be specified with the ``geometry`` "
"keyword. The action of the instanton, its fluctuations and the fluctuations "
"about the well minimum are printed to the output file. Molpro computes the "
"tunnelling-matrix element which can be used to construct the tunnelling-"
"splitting pattern for a molecular cluster with two or more degenerate wells "
"as described in the latter of the two references. It is necessary to "
"converge the results in the limit that :math:`\\beta\\rightarrow\\infty` and"
" :math:`\\beta/N\\rightarrow0`."
msgstr ""
"阱最小值处的几何结构应使用 ``geometry`` 关键词指定。瞬子的作用量、其涨落以及阱最小值附近的涨落将被打印到输出文件中。Molpro "
"计算隧穿矩阵元，该矩阵元可用于构建具有两个或更多简并阱的分子簇的隧穿分裂模式，如后一篇参考文献所述。必须在 "
":math:`\\beta\\rightarrow\\infty` 和 :math:`\\beta/N\\rightarrow0` 的极限下收敛结果。"

msgid "Input file"
msgstr "输入文件"

msgid ""
"An input file should be supplied in ``xyz`` format containing the Cartesian "
"coordinates (in Ångstroms) of the beads used to initialize the instanton "
"optimization. A rate calculation requires :math:`N/2` beads, whereas a "
"tunnelling-splitting calculation requires :math:`N`. The first line contains"
" the number of atoms in the system and the second has two numbers: "
":math:`N`, the number of beads, and :math:`T`, temperature in Kelvin (for "
"the case of a rate calculation) or :math:`\\beta`, the reciprocal "
"temperature in atomic units (for the case of a tunnelling-splittings "
"calculation). These two lines appear before the coordinates of each bead "
"which are given one atom per line including the element symbol."
msgstr ""
"应提供一个 ``xyz`` 格式的输入文件，其中包含用于初始化瞬子优化的珠子的笛卡尔坐标（以埃为单位）。速率计算需要 :math:`N/2` "
"个珠子，而隧穿分裂计算需要 :math:`N` 个珠子。第一行包含系统中的原子数，第二行有两个数字：\\ :math:`N`\\ （珠子数量）和 "
":math:`T`\\ （开尔文温度，用于速率计算情况）或 :math:`\\beta`\\ "
"（以原子单位为单位的倒数温度，用于隧穿分裂计算情况）。这两行出现在每个珠子的坐标之前，每个珠子的坐标按原子逐行给出，包括元素符号。"

msgid "Procedures"
msgstr "过程"

msgid ""
"A few procedures must be defined. ``beadpot`` defines the method for "
"computing the potential energy of a single bead geometry. ``beadgrad`` gives"
" the method for computing the gradient for a bead using the ``force`` "
"command. ``beadfreq1``, ``beadfreq2`` and ``beadfreq3`` define methods for "
"computing frequencies of the transition state/well minimum, of the initial "
"(pre-optimized) ring-polymer beads and of the final (optimized) beads. "
"Because the procedure ``beadfreq1`` is only called once directly after "
"``beadpot``, it is not necessary to recalculate the wave-function in this "
"case. For the tunnelling-splitting calculations, ``beadfreq2`` is not used "
"as the L-BFGS optimization proceeds without a Hessian."
msgstr ""
"必须定义几个过程。\\ ``beadpot`` 定义了计算单个珠子几何构型势能的方法。\\ ``beadgrad`` 给出了使用 ``force`` "
"命令计算珠子梯度的方法。\\ ``beadfreq1``\\ 、\\ ``beadfreq2`` 和 ``beadfreq3`` "
"定义了计算过渡态/势阱最小值、初始（预优化）环聚合物珠子和最终（优化后）珠子的频率的方法。由于过程 ``beadfreq1`` 仅在 "
"``beadpot`` 之后被调用一次，因此在这种情况下不需要重新计算波函数。对于隧穿分裂计算，\\ ``beadfreq2`` 不被使用，因为 "
"L-BFGS 优化在没有 Hessian 矩阵的情况下进行。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"``SPLITTING`` runs the tunnelling splitting calculation instead of a rate "
"calculation. The default is False."
msgstr "``SPLITTING`` 运行隧穿分裂计算，而不是速率计算。默认值为 False。"

msgid ""
"``BANDED`` Uses a banded-matrix eigensolver in the quasi-Newton "
"optimization. The default is False."
msgstr "``BANDED`` 在准牛顿优化中使用带状矩阵特征求解器。默认值为 False。"

msgid ""
"``DISPLACEMENT`` Run parallel over atomic displacements instead of over "
"beads when calculating bead Hessians. The default is False."
msgstr "``DISPLACEMENT`` 在计算珠子 Hessian 矩阵时，按原子位移而非珠子进行并行化。默认值为 False。"

msgid "Parallelization"
msgstr "并行化"

msgid ""
"The ring-polymer instanton approach is naturally parallelized by computing "
"the energies and gradients of each bead on separate processors. It is "
"recommended for the number of processors used to be a factor of the number "
"of beads."
msgstr "环聚合物瞬子方法天然地通过在不同处理器上计算每个珠子的能量和梯度来实现并行化。建议使用的处理器数量是珠子数量的一个因子。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"In both examples, data is saved to a ``.wfu`` file. If another instanton "
"calculation at a different temperature or with a different number of beads "
"is run, some information can be recovered by using "
"``frequencies,read=5300.2`` in ``beadfreq1``."
msgstr ""
"在这两个示例中，数据都保存到\\ ``.wfu``\\ 文件中。如果在不同温度或使用不同珠子数量运行另一个瞬子计算，可以通过在\\ "
"``beadfreq1``\\ 中使用\\ ``frequencies,read=5300.2``\\ 来恢复一些信息。"

msgid "Instanton scripts"
msgstr "瞬子脚本"

msgid ""
"All scripts require the *numpy*, *scipy* and *matplotlib* libraries. These "
"can be installed via pip3:"
msgstr "所有脚本都需要 *numpy*\\ 、\\ *scipy* 和 *matplotlib* 库。这些库可以通过 pip3 安装："

msgid "How to use the scripts"
msgstr "如何使用这些脚本"

msgid ""
"**initial_instanton.py** creates an initial guess for a half-instanton "
"configuration for a given number of beads. It uses the transition state "
"geometry and the mass-weighted eigenvector corresponding to the imaginary "
"mode. As a result you must have a Molpro xml file as a result of a previous "
"frequencies calculation."
msgstr ""
"**initial_instanton.py** "
"为给定珠子数的半瞬子构型创建初始猜测。它使用过渡态几何结构和对应于虚模的质量加权本征向量。因此，您必须拥有先前频率计算结果的 Molpro xml "
"文件。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid ""
"This will generate 16 bead geometries in the file ’initial.xyz’ and labeled "
"by the given temperature. A sensible temperature should be less than the "
"cross-over temperature. If a temperature is not supplied, the -g option can "
"be given and a suitable estimate temperature will be generated; this is "
"chosen to be at least 20 Kelvin below the cross-over temperature. See ref "
"for more details on how the bead geometries are generated. Choosing an s "
"value should be done with trial and error to give a small but observable "
"stretch. However s=0.1 is often good enough."
msgstr ""
"这将在文件 'initial.xyz' 中生成 16 个珠子几何结构，并用给定的温度标记。合理的温度应低于交叉温度。如果未提供温度，可以使用 -g "
"选项，系统将生成一个合适的估计温度；该温度被选择为至少低于交叉温度 20 开尔文。有关珠子几何结构生成方式的更多详细信息，请参见参考文献。选择 s "
"值应通过试错法进行，以产生较小但可观察到的拉伸。然而，s=0.1 通常就足够好了。"

msgid ""
"For more information on how the initial bead geometries are calculated, see:"
msgstr "有关初始珠子几何结构计算方式的更多信息，请参见："

msgid ""
"**interpolate_instaton.py** creates an initial guess for a half-instanton "
"configuration using inputs of a previously optimized instanton for a "
"different number of beads or different temperature. Note that the half-"
"instanton will only have N/2 beads. If temperature is not given, the same is"
" retained from the input file. If the number of beads is not given, the "
"previous number is doubled. This script will also interpolate the Hessians "
"of each bead if provided with the correct file (use the hessfile option in "
"the input to save the final bead Hessians)."
msgstr ""
"**interpolate_instaton.py** 使用先前针对不同珠子数或不同温度优化的瞬子的输入，为半瞬子构型创建初始猜测。请注意，半瞬子将只有"
" N/2 个珠子。如果未给出温度，则保留输入文件中的温度。如果未给出珠子数，则之前的数量会加倍。如果提供了正确的文件（在输入中使用 hessfile "
"选项保存最终的珠子 Hessian 矩阵），此脚本还会对每个珠子的 Hessian 矩阵进行插值。"

msgid ""
"Assuming ’final.xyz’ has 16/2 (8) bead geometries, this will place 32/2 (16)"
" bead geometries into ’inital.xyz’ labeled with the temperature."
msgstr ""
"假设 'final.xyz' 包含 16/2 (8) 个珠子几何构型，这会将 32/2 (16) 个珠子几何构型放入 'initial.xyz' "
"中，并标记温度。"

msgid ""
"**plot_instanton.py** uses matplotlib to plot the reaction pathway. An "
"output file can be generated which can then be plotted using other plotting "
"programs (eg. gnuplot). It uses a set of optimized bead geometries and the "
"final bead energies contained in a Molpro xml file. This is the potential "
"along the mass-weighted path length and so also uses the atomic masses also "
"contained in a Molpro xml file."
msgstr ""
"**plot_instanton.py** 使用 matplotlib 绘制反应路径。可以生成一个输出文件，然后使用其他绘图程序（例如 "
"gnuplot）进行绘制。它使用一组优化后的珠子几何构型以及包含在 Molpro xml "
"文件中的最终珠子能量。这是沿质量加权路径长度的势能，因此也使用同样包含在 Molpro xml 文件中的原子质量。"

msgid ""
"The -r flag can be used to specify the reactant energy to scale the plot "
"with respect to this number."
msgstr "-r 标志可用于指定反应物能量，以便相对于此数值缩放绘图。"

msgid ""
"Instantons can be located within the ring-polymer formalism using the "
"``INSTANTON`` command: ``INSTANTON[, key1=value, key2=value, …]\\\\`` These "
"instantons can be used to compute either the thermal reaction rate or the "
"tunnelling splitting between degenerate potential wells. The behaviour can "
"be controlled with the ``splitting`` option. It is a good idea to turn "
"symmetry off (using ``nosym``) during the calculation as the ring-polymer "
"beads do not necessarily share the same symmetry operations as the "
"transition state or well minima."
msgstr ""
"可以使用\\ ``INSTANTON``\\ 命令在环聚合物形式下定位瞬子：\\ ``INSTANTON[, key1=value, "
"key2=value, …]\\\\``\\ 这些瞬子可用于计算热反应速率或简并势阱之间的隧穿分裂。该行为可通过\\ ``splitting``\\ "
"选项进行控制。在计算过程中关闭对称性（使用\\ ``nosym``\\ ）是一个好主意，因为环聚合物珠子不一定与过渡态或势阱极小点具有相同的对称操作。"

msgid ""
"Richardson and S. C. Althorpe. “Ring-polymer molecular dynamics rate-theory "
"in the deep-tunneling regime: Connection with semiclassical instanton "
"theory.” `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3267318>`__ **131**, "
"214106 (2009)."
msgstr ""
"Richardson and S. C. Althorpe. “Ring-polymer molecular dynamics rate-theory "
"in the deep-tunneling regime: Connection with semiclassical instanton "
"theory.” `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3267318>`__ **131**, "
"214106 (2009)."

msgid ""
"Richardson. “Derivation of instanton rate theory from first principles.” `J."
" Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4943866>`__ **144**, 114106 "
"(2016)."
msgstr ""
"Richardson. “Derivation of instanton rate theory from first principles.” `J."
" Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4943866>`__ **144**, 114106 "
"(2016)."

msgid ""
"Beyer, J. O. Richardson, P. J. Knowles, J. Rommel and S. C. Althorpe "
"“Quantum tunneling rates of gas-phase reactions from on-the-fly instanton "
"calculations.” *J. Phys. Chem. Lett.* **7**, 4374-4379 (2016)."
msgstr ""
"Beyer, J. O. Richardson, P. J. Knowles, J. Rommel and S. C. Althorpe "
"“Quantum tunneling rates of gas-phase reactions from on-the-fly instanton "
"calculations.” *J. Phys. Chem. Lett.* **7**, 4374-4379 (2016)."

msgid ""
"Nocedal. “Updating quasi-Newton matrices with limited storage”. *Math. "
"Comput.* **35**, 773 (1980)."
msgstr ""
"Nocedal. “Updating quasi-Newton matrices with limited storage”. *Math. "
"Comput.* **35**, 773 (1980)."

msgid ""
"Liu and J. Nocedal. “On the limited memory BFGS method for large scale "
"optimization”. *Math. Program.* **45**, 503 (1989)."
msgstr ""
"Liu and J. Nocedal. “On the limited memory BFGS method for large scale "
"optimization”. *Math. Program.* **45**, 503 (1989)."

msgid ""
"Richardson and S. C. Althorpe. “Ring-polymer instanton method for "
"calculating tunneling splittings.” `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3530589>`__ **134**, 054109 (2011)."
msgstr ""
"Richardson and S. C. Althorpe. “Ring-polymer instanton method for "
"calculating tunneling splittings.” `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3530589>`__ **134**, 054109 (2011)."

msgid ""
"Richardson, S. C. Althorpe and D. J. Wales. “Instanton calculations of "
"tunneling splittings for water dimer and trimer.” `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3640429>`__ **135**, 124109 (2011)."
msgstr ""
"Richardson, S. C. Althorpe and D. J. Wales. “Instanton calculations of "
"tunneling splittings for water dimer and trimer.” `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3640429>`__ **135**, 124109 (2011)."

msgid ""
"**``INPUT``\\ =\\ *filename*** file containing initial instanton geometry in"
" format described in section `input file <instantons.html#input-file>`__. "
"The default is initial.xyz."
msgstr ""
"**``INPUT``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 包含初始瞬子几何结构的文件，格式见\\ `input file "
"<instantons.html#input-file>`__\\ 一节所述。默认为 initial.xyz。"

msgid ""
"**``OUTPUT``\\ =\\ *filename*** file containing final instanton geometry in "
"format described in section `input file <instantons.html#input-file>`__. The"
" default is final.xyz."
msgstr ""
"**``OUTPUT``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 包含最终瞬子几何结构的文件，格式见\\ `input file "
"<instantons.html#input-file>`__\\ 一节所述。默认为 final.xyz。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *filename*** file containing transition-state data, "
"including potential, Hessian eigenvalues and the number of imaginary and "
"zero frequencies. The default is ’.’ in which case no files are read or "
"written."
msgstr ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 包含过渡态数据的文件，包括势能、Hessian 本征值以及虚频和零频数。默认为 "
"’.’，此时不读取或写入任何文件。"

msgid ""
"**``REACTANT``\\ =\\ *value*** value of potential (in :math:`E_{\\text{h}}`)"
" of reactant states used to scale the instanton action in a rate calculation"
" only. The default is 0."
msgstr ""
"**``REACTANT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 反应物态势能值（单位 :math:`E_{\\text{h}}`\\ "
"），仅用于在速率计算中缩放瞬子作用量。默认为 0。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXIT``\\ =\\ *integer*** maximum number of optimization cycles. The "
"default is 50."
msgstr "**``MAXIT``\\ =\\ *\\ integer*** 最大优化循环次数。默认为 50。"

msgid ""
"**``GRADIENT``\\ =\\ *value*** required accuracy of the optimized ring-"
"polymer gradient. The default is :math:`3 \\cdot 10^{-4}`."
msgstr ""
"**``GRADIENT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 优化后环聚合物梯度的所需精度。默认为 :math:`3 \\cdot "
"10^{-4}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``STEPMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** maximum allowed step (in Bohr) in the quasi-"
"Newton instanton optimization. Attempted steps larger than this are scaled "
"down. The default is :math:`0\\cdot3` :math:`a_0`."
msgstr ""
"**``STEPMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 准牛顿瞬子优化中允许的最大步长（单位为 "
"Bohr）。大于此值的尝试步长会被按比例缩小。默认为 :math:`0\\cdot3` :math:`a_0`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MSAVE``\\ =\\ *integer*** number of gradients saved from previous "
"iterations used in the L-BFGS optimization. The default is 3."
msgstr "**``MSAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ integer*** 在 L-BFGS 优化中使用的、来自前几次迭代所保存的梯度数。默认为 3。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVEHESS``\\ =\\ *filename*** file containing bead Hessians. The default"
" is ’.’ in which case no files are written."
msgstr "**``SAVEHESS``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 包含珠子 Hessian 的文件。默认为 ’.’，此时不写入任何文件。"

msgid ""
"**``READHESS``\\ =\\ *filename*** reads file containing bead Hessians. The "
"default is ’.’ in which case no files are read."
msgstr "**``READHESS``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 读取包含珠子 Hessian 的文件。默认为 ’.’，此时不读取任何文件。"

msgid ""
"Here we give an example for calculating the rate of the "
":math:`\\mathrm{H+H_2\\rightarrow H_2+H}` reaction at 250 K using MRCI. The "
"Molpro input file is below and requires also `instanton_initial.xyz "
"<media/examples/instanton_initial.xyz>`__."
msgstr ""
"这里给出一个使用 MRCI 计算 250 K 下 :math:`\\mathrm{H+H_2\\rightarrow H_2+H}` "
"反应速率的示例。Molpro 输入文件如下，并且还需要\\ `instanton_initial.xyz "
"<media/examples/instanton_initial.xyz>`__\\ 。"

msgid "examples/instanton.inp"
msgstr "examples/instanton.inp"

msgid ""
"An example calculation of the tunnelling splitting in the "
":math:`\\mathrm{HO_2}` cluster using UHF is provided by the input below "
"which requires the `splitting_initial.xyz "
"<media/examples/splitting_initial.xyz>`__ input file."
msgstr ""
"下面给出的输入提供了一个使用 UHF 计算 :math:`\\mathrm{HO_2}` 团簇中隧穿分裂的示例，该示例需要\\ "
"`splitting_initial.xyz <media/examples/splitting_initial.xyz>`__\\ 输入文件。"

msgid "examples/splitting.inp"
msgstr "examples/splitting.inp"

msgid ""
"Four python scripts are available in Molpro which can ease the calculation "
"of instantons. For usage and options, run the scripts with the -h flag. All "
"scripts are written in python3 and require the use of the vmd.py module. For"
" UNIX based operating systems, the module should be placed in a directory "
"included in ``$PYTHONPATH``, while the other scripts should be placed "
"somewhere in ``$PATH``."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中提供了四个 Python 脚本，可简化瞬子的计算。有关用法和选项，请使用 -h 标志运行这些脚本。所有脚本均用 python3 "
"编写，并且需要使用 vmd.py 模块。对于基于 UNIX 的操作系统，该模块应放置在包含在\\ ``$PYTHONPATH``\\ "
"中的目录中，而其他脚本应放置在\\ ``$PATH``\\ 中的某个位置。"
